7ae38c80cc"], "query_ids": ["q_25"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_3cd18acdd655483e1ea85210", "quote": "A 25% tariff took effect on April 3, 2025, for imported automobiles and light trucks, and on May 3, 2025, for specific auto parts such as engines, transmissions, and electrical components.", "url": "https://www.ghy.com/trade-compliance/us-to-apply-a-25-tariff-on-imports-of-autos-and-parts", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Proclamation 10908", "effective_date": "April 3, 2025"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_9b7443da9108707ae38c80cc", "quote": "On March 26, 2025, the President issued Proclamation 10908 on Adjusting Imports of Automobiles and Automobile Parts into the United States, imposing a 25 percent ad valorem tariff on parts of passenger vehicles (sedans, sport utility vehicles, crossover utility vehicles, minivans, and cargo vans) and light trucks from all countries, under Section 232 of the Trade Expansion Act of 1962, as amended (19 U.S.C. 1862) (Section 232), effective May 3, 2025.", "url": "https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDHSCBP/bulletins/3de7ef9", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"legal_authority": "Section 232 of the Trade Expansion Act of 1962", "affected_product": "parts of passenger vehicles (sedans, sport utility vehicles, crossover utility vehicles, minivans, and cargo vans) and light trucks"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_f5c57af55260f5b75cced51a", "claim_ids": ["claim_5db8f135b1cef76d20b5d6de", "claim_5de1cc2e501fed5724ce58a2"], "query_ids": ["q_25"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_5db8f135b1cef76d20b5d6de", "quote": "Section 232 duties are not drawback-eligible; Section 301 is. All rates as of July 2026 — verify current status before filing.", "url": "https://gingercontrol.com/industries/automotive-parts", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {}}, {"claim_id": "claim_5de1cc2e501fed5724ce58a2", "quote": "If you import components, build them into vehicles or parts in the U.S., and export the finished goods, you may recover up to 99% of eligible duties, taxes, and fees. The critical boundary: Section 232 duties are NOT drawback-eligible, so the dominant 25% auto-parts layer is not recoverable — but Section 301, base MFN, and MPF/HMF are.", "url": "https://gingercontrol.com/industries/automotive-parts", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_4f8f14a0a2ec7a61a3993192", "claim_ids": ["claim_03f89f404b869a08693acec9", "claim_d513d5594c2e8cbe38207641"], "query_ids": ["q_251"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_03f89f404b869a08693acec9", "quote": "No, goods subject to Section 232 tariffs are excepted from IEEPA Reciprocal tariffs under exception 9903.01.33.", "url": "https://www.cbp.gov/trade/programs-administration/trade-remedies/IEEPA-FAQ", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {"tariff_program": "IEEPA Reciprocal tariffs", "hts_code": "9903.01.33"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_d513d5594c2e8cbe38207641", "quote": "Articles subject to the section 232 duties imposed on autos and auto parts under Proclamation 10908 (March 26, 2025), as amended, are not subject to the IEEPA duties imposed on products of Canada (EO 14193, as amended) or Mexico (EO 14194, as amended) as detailed in CSMS # 65236574 -UPDATED GUIDANCE – Proclamation “Adjusting Imports of Aluminum and Steel in the United States,” Amending Executive Order 14289, “Addressing Certain Tariffs on Imported Articles”. Nor are such articles subject to the IEEPA Reciprocal duties (EO 14257, as amended) under heading 9903.01.33, HTSUS.", "url": "https://www.cbp.gov/trade/programs-administration/trade-remedies/IEEPA-FAQ", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {"tariff_program": "IEEPA Reciprocal duties", "legal_authority": "Proclamation 10908", "affected_product": "autos and auto parts", "country_of_origin": "Canada"}}]}]}

